    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d406">

                <pb facs="0730" n="598" xml:id="pg598"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 EAC/7–445: Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 406<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Winant</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent―niact</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-07-04T20:00:00+02:00">July 4, 1945—8
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>6740. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Comea</hi> 318. Today EAC approved in substance draft agreement on French zone in
                    Germany. Texts to be checked tomorrow by experts subcommittee preparatory to
                    signature.</p>
                <p>Sent Dept 6740; rptd Paris 435 secret for Caffery and Murphy.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Winant</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
